        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: আগামী",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "আগামী — āgāmī — \"next, coming\". Bengali's future adds -ব for \"I\": আমি আগামী সপ্তাহে যাব — āmi āgāmī sôptāhe jābô — \"I will go next week.\""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "আগামী (āgāmī) is Sanskrit āgāmin, \"coming, future\", taken over whole as a learned loan, a tatsama."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
