          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "এরপর — erpôr — \"after this, from now on\". It is এর, \"of this\", with পর, \"after\"; add থেকে, \"from\", for \"from now on\": এরপর থেকে আমি রোজ হাঁটব — erpôr theke āmi roj hā̃ṭbô — \"From now on I will walk every day.\""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "এরপর (erpôr) is er, \"of this\", the near head e- with the possessive -r, + pôr, \"after\", from Sanskrit para, \"later\" (CDIAL 7793)."
            }
          ]
        },
